  "title": "How are you feeling?",
  "goal": "Say how you and others feel, and recognize to be with -dYr.",
  "points": ["gp-copula-present", "gp-harmony-rounding", "gp-personal-pronouns"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Feelings work like jobs: *Men ýadaw* (I'm tired), *Ol aç* (he's hungry). In careful style the third person adds `-dYr`: *-dyr* after a back vowel, *-dir* after a front one: *Ol keseldir* (she is ill). Formal writing uses *-dYr* with an ending in every person: *Men ýadawdyryn*.",
    "see": "gp-copula-present"
  },
